    <script type="application/ld+json">
      {"@context":"http://schema.org","@graph":[{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Attio","url":"https://uk.linkedin.com/company/attio"},"datePublished":"2026-07-02T13:13:06.392Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/attio_were-teaming-up-with-modal-and-parallel-activity-7478435586438144001-QRR1","text":"We're teaming up with Modal and Parallel Web Systems for an evening of talks on scaling agentic growth systems.\n\nGTM engineers from our teams will cover orchestrating agentic GTM workflows end to end, transforming GTM data into agent-ready input, and tracking ROI as you scale agents across the funnel.\n\nJoin us in London on July 14th: attio.ai/scaling-growth","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/attio_were-teaming-up-with-modal-and-parallel-activity-7478435586438144001-QRR1"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Attio","url":"https://uk.linkedin.com/company/attio"},"datePublished":"2026-06-29T14:57:49.561Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/attio_70-people-showed-up-during-a-heatwave-to-activity-7477374776316080129-GKgA","text":"70 people showed up during a heatwave to build.\n\nLast Saturday we hosted the {Tech: Europe} hackathon at our London office. It was incredible to see so many people building on top of Attio. \n\nThe standout project was SellFast by Yanhong (Billy) Zhao and Vincent Hao, who built a Pokémon battle sales training tool that pulls call recordings from Attio and uses voice agents to run live battles where reps face real customer questions.\n\nThey walked away with the Attio track and the overall win.\n\nCongrats to every team that shipped something on the day. You set the bar for the next one.","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/attio_70-people-showed-up-during-a-heatwave-to-activity-7477374776316080129-GKgA"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Attio","url":"https://uk.linkedin.com/company/attio"},"datePublished":"2026-06-25T14:10:28.927Z","headline":"","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/attio_were-entering-the-age-of-the-renaissance-activity-7475913310379511808-tr3B","text":"We're entering the age of the renaissance CSM.\n\nBeing great with customers is no longer enough. Today's best CSMs are technical enough to build workflows beside customers, commercial enough to carry the renewal, and strategic enough to drive expansion.\n\nBo Sun, Global Head of CS at Notion, wrote the playbook on this shift and what it takes to build a CS team that operates as the growth engine of the company.\n\nRead his full entry: attio.ai/bo-gtmatlas","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/attio_were-entering-the-age-of-the-renaissance-activity-7475913310379511808-tr3B"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Attio","url":"https://uk.linkedin.com/company/attio"},"datePublished":"2026-06-23T13:07:35.367Z","headline":"","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/attio_turn-outreach-into-pipeline-with-lemlist-activity-7475172707228135425-CEZL","text":"Turn outreach into pipeline with lemlist + Attio.\n\nRun outbound directly from your CRM. Add contacts to campaigns, enrich lead data, track activity, and automate follow-ups. Keep every record in sync without switching tabs.\n\nCheck it out here: attio.ai/lemlist-app","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/attio_turn-outreach-into-pipeline-with-lemlist-activity-7475172707228135425-CEZL"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Attio","url":"https://uk.linkedin.com/company/attio"},"datePublished":"2026-06-18T15:03:24.650Z","headline":"","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/attio_gtm-atlas-volume-ii-is-live-were-back-activity-7473389915263860736-pHwK","text":"GTM Atlas Volume II is live.\n\nWe're back with more frameworks, systems, and insights from some of the best operators building right now.\n\nRead six new entries from Cristina Cordova, Malhar S., Shreman Shrestha, Ben Thirlwall, Bo Sun, and Travis Bryant.\n\nPlus a curated stack of perks from Wispr Flow, Granola, Notion, and Anthropic.\n\nStart exploring: attio.ai/gtm-atlas","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/attio_gtm-atlas-volume-ii-is-live-were-back-activity-7473389915263860736-pHwK"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Attio","url":"https://uk.linkedin.com/company/attio"},"datePublished":"2026-06-11T13:23:56.167Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/attio_attio-in-the-economist-start-with-5-down-activity-7470828166572584960-04cT","text":"Attio in The Economist.\n\nStart with 5 down.\n\nattio.com/london","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/attio_attio-in-the-economist-start-with-5-down-activity-7470828166572584960-04cT"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Attio","url":"https://uk.linkedin.com/company/attio"},"datePublished":"2026-06-09T17:05:45.485Z","headline":"","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/attio_introducing-the-new-workflows-orchestrate-activity-7470159214171193344-6WqR","text":"Introducing the new Workflows.\n\nOrchestrate your entire revenue motion.\n\nYour agents research, route, and run your best plays across every account, at infinite scale, on the deepest context layer in AI CRM.\n\nIf you can describe it, Attio runs it.\n\nConduct your revenue: attio.ai/agent-workflows","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/attio_introducing-the-new-workflows-orchestrate-activity-7470159214171193344-6WqR"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Attio","url":"https://uk.linkedin.com/company/attio"},"datePublished":"2026-06-04T10:56:11.691Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/attio_were-running-free-operator-hours-out-of-activity-7468254271340302336-Hf_j","text":"We're running free Operator Hours out of our London office this month. If you're an early-stage GTM team trying to get your CRM setup right or sharpen your GTM motion, come spend some time with us.\n\nEach session is a structured 1:1 with an AE, SE, or CSM matched to what you want to work on. Leave with a clearer CRM setup, concrete next steps, and a plan you can act on immediately.\n\nBuilt for seed and Series A teams with under 50 people who can make it to London in person. \n\nApply now: attio.ai/operator-hours","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/attio_were-running-free-operator-hours-out-of-activity-7468254271340302336-Hf_j"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"Organization","name":"Attio","url":"https://uk.linkedin.com/company/attio","address":{"type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"London","addressCountry":"GB"},"description":"Attio is the AI CRM for the next era of companies.","numberOfEmployees":{"value":182,"@type":"QuantitativeValue"},"logo":{"contentUrl":"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C4D0BAQF16UXOMcHaCA/company-logo_200_200/company-logo_200_200/0/1670519496148/attio_logo?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=1Tgkqt6FWRN84JYVjo1GitVkZnUIe2cOX4x3syrRE-U","description":"Attio","@type":"ImageObject"},"slogan":"The AI CRM for GTM builders.","sameAs":"attio.com"}]}
    </script>
  
  
      
