    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">We're teaming up with <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/modal-labs?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Modal</a> and <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/parallel-web?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Parallel Web Systems</a> for an evening of talks on scaling agentic growth systems.

GTM engineers from our teams will cover orchestrating agentic GTM workflows end to end, transforming GTM data into agent-ready input, and tracking ROI as you scale agents across the funnel.

Join us in London on July 14th: <a class="link" href="http://attio.ai/scaling-growth?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>attio.ai/scaling-growth</a></p>
