  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        attributed-text-segment-list__content-truncated" dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">GTM Atlas Volume II is live.

We're back with more frameworks, systems, and insights from some of the best operators building right now.

Read six new entries from <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/cristinajcordova?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Cristina Cordova</a>, <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/malhar-singh?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Malhar S.</a>, <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/in/shreman?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Shreman Shrestha</a>, <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/in/ben-thirlwall-98a2a12?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Ben Thirlwall</a>, <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/bosunnusob?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Bo Sun</a>, and <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/tbryant80?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Travis Bryant</a>.

Plus a curated stack of perks from <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/wisprflow?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Wispr Flow</a>, <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/company/meetgranola?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Granola</a>, <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/notionhq?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Notion</a>, and <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/anthropicresearch?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Anthropic</a>.

Start exploring: <a class="link" href="http://attio.ai/gtm-atlas?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>attio.ai/gtm-atlas</a></p>
          
            
                  
    

