  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        attributed-text-segment-list__content-truncated" dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">Super excited to share our brand new Agent functionality with the world powered by a new workflow engine built from the ground up for AI!

Our latest launch builds on our experience orchestrating over 200 million workflow runs for some of the world's fastest growing GTM teams. We've created the foundational system for deploying frontier intelligence into the revenue stack at unlimited scale.

With Universal Context at the core, Workflows with Custom Agents make autonomous research, routing, outreach and account management a single click. Combining Attio data with context held in other systems empowers agents with previously impossible capabilities. 

To that end, we're also announcing a wide range of integration partnerships with leading tools in the ecosystem like <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/lemlist?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>lemlist</a>, <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/parallel-web?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Parallel Web Systems</a>, <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/stripe?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Stripe</a>, <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/intercom?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Intercom</a>, <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/outreach-saas?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Outreach</a>, <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/company/meetgranola?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Granola</a>, <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/company/scribeless?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Scribeless</a> and many more to bring all of your GTM context and activities in reach of your agents. With support for custom MCP servers, inline code execution and custom workflow blocks, our Workflow engine is now fully equipped to sit at the heart of any revenue orchestration, no matter the complexity.

For existing Attio customers, Ask Attio to build a new Workflow for you today!

For those who are curious about what the next generation revenue stack look like check out: <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/eXiEfSBZ?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/eXiEfSBZ</a></p>
          
            
                  
    

