  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        attributed-text-segment-list__content-truncated" dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">Introducing the new Workflows.

The market has moved. Customers want a system that thinks, researches, routes, and follows up across their entire revenue motion. We've built Workflows for exactly that.

Two things I'm most excited about: Custom Agents that run any motion you can imagine, wired into your entire ecosystem. And our agentic workflow builder - describe what you want, <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/company/attio?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Attio</a> builds it.

Brief every meeting. Enrich and route every lead. Follow up on every deal. At infinite scale, on Universal Context, the deepest data layer in AI CRM.

Hundreds of thousands of automations already run on Attio every day. This takes it to a completely different level and I couldn't be more proud of the team that built it.

<a class="link" href="http://attio.ai/agent-workflows?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>attio.ai/agent-workflows</a></p>
          
            
                  
    

