  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">We're running free Operator Hours out of our London office this month. If you're an early-stage GTM team trying to get your CRM setup right or sharpen your GTM motion, come spend some time with us.

Each session is a structured 1:1 with an AE, SE, or CSM matched to what you want to work on. Leave with a clearer CRM setup, concrete next steps, and a plan you can act on immediately.

Built for seed and Series A teams with under 50 people who can make it to London in person. 

Apply now: <a class="link" href="http://attio.ai/operator-hours?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>attio.ai/operator-hours</a></p>
<!---->  </div>



        

        
            
      
    
    
    

